cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SoftVTBench, please cite the paper below."
title: "SoftVTBench: A Safety-Aware Visuo-Tactile Benchmark for Physically Constrained Robotic Manipulation of Deformable Objects"
abstract: >-
  A safety-aware visuo-tactile benchmark for physically constrained deformable
  object manipulation. Built in Isaac Sim with FEM-simulated deformable objects,
  it provides multi-view RGB, RGB tactile sensing with marker motion,
  proprioception, and language instructions across four matched task suites
  (object/spatial x deformable/rigid), and reports Goal Success and Safety
  Success separately.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/TuojingAI/SoftVTBench"
url: "https://softvtbench.github.io/"
license: Apache-2.0
